# Base URL for game audio (music + note samples + SFX).
# Leave unset to use the public CDN (default in dev and prod).
# Set VITE_ASSET_BASE=./assets only if you copied the ~840 MB of audio into public/assets.
#
# To serve from Cloudflare R2, copy this file to `.env` and set the two bases.
#
# 1) ASSET_BASE = background music (nivel-X/) + game SFX/loops (samples/).
#    Must directly contain `nivel-1/`…`nivel-5/` and `samples/`, e.g.:
#      ${VITE_ASSET_BASE}/nivel-1/jazz-01.mp3
#      ${VITE_ASSET_BASE}/samples/acierto.mp3
# VITE_ASSET_BASE=https://<your-r2-public-host>/music/oido-absoluto-multi
#
# 2) NOTES_BASE = instrument note samples (Piano/, Cello/, …), shared at the
#    bucket ROOT across all the ear-training apps, e.g.:
#      ${VITE_NOTES_BASE}/Piano/C3.mp3
#    Leave unset to read notes from ${ASSET_BASE}/samples (local layout).
# VITE_NOTES_BASE=https://<your-r2-public-host>
